            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "décaler — \"to shift, to move (a time)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La compagnie a décalé le départ d'une heure. The airline moved the departure by an hour."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Décaler un rendez-vous — to move an appointment."
            }
